  "answer": "Technical support answers must qualify that PDF citation availability depends on document quality: precise page/paragraph-level citations are only reliable for natively digital, text-based PDFs. Image-only, photocopied, or low-quality scans lack native text layers and require OCR; if OCR output is broken or incomplete, citations may be missing, link to the wrong page, or TutorChat may say it cannot find the answer [NL-002#NL-002-S09]. The recommended qualification is to advise converting scanned documents to structured digital, text-searchable formats before upload [NL-002#NL-002-S09][NL-028#NL-028-S03].\n\nANSWER_STATUS: answer  \nUSED_MEMORY_CLAIMS: none",
